  93\t#### A.3 Lesson Completion\n    94\t```\n    95\tREQ-QUIZ-003: POST /api/v1/motifs/{motif_id}/complete-lesson\n    96\t├── WHEN a user completes reading lesson content\n    97\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\n    98\t│   ├── Update UserProgress.lesson_viewed_at = now()\n    99\t│   ├── Return quiz_unlocked: true\n   100\t│   └── Award +10 XP for lesson completion\n   101\t└── IF lesson already viewed THEN skip XP award\n   102\t```\n   103\t\n   104\t#### A.4 Quiz History\n   105\t```\n   106\tREQ-QUIZ-004: GET /api/v1/users/me/quiz-history\n   107\t├── WHEN a user requests their quiz history\n   108\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return paginated list of attempts:\n   109\t│   ├── attempt_id, motif_id, motif_name\n   110\t│   ├── score, xp_earned, passed (bool)\n   111\t│   ├── time_taken_seconds\n   112\t│   └── created_at\n   113\t└── SUPPORT query params: ?motif_id=&limit=20&offset=0\n   114\t```\n   115\t\n   116\t---\n   117\t\n   118\t### 2.2 DOMAIN B: GAMIFICATION (Badges & Achievements)\n   119\t\n   120\t#### B.1 Badge Definitions (Seed Data)\n   121\t```\n   122\tREQ-BADGE-001: Badge Categories\n   123\t├── discovery: First discoveries, exploration milestones\n   124\t├── collection: Collection completion (per urn, per category)\n   125\t├── mastery: Quiz performance, perfect scores\n   126\t├── streak: Daily activity consistency\n   127\t└── special: Hidden achievements, events\n   128\t```\n   129\t\n   130\t#### B.2 Badge Criteria Table\n   131\t```\n   132\t| Badge Slug              | Category   | Criteria                           | XP Bonus |\n   133\t|-------------------------|------------|---------------------------------------|----------|\n   134\t| first_discovery         | discovery  | Discover 1 motif                      | 50       |\n   135\t| explorer_10             | discovery  | Discover 10 motifs                    | 100      |\n   136\t| explorer_50             | discovery  | Discover 50 motifs                    | 250      |\n   137\t| explorer_10