atalog\n   166\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return all badges with:\n   167\t│   ├── slug, name, name_en, description\n   168\t│   ├── icon_url, category\n   169\t│   └── is_hidden (for secret badges)\n   170\t└── Hidden badges show \"???\" until earned\n   171\t\n   172\tREQ-BADGE-004: POST /api/v1/badges/check (Internal)\n   173\t├── WHEN any XP-awarding action completes\n   174\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\n   175\t│   ├── Query all unearned badges for user\n   176\t│   ├── Check each badge's criteria\n   177\t│   ├── Award badge if criteria met\n   178\t│   └── Return newly earned badges for notification\n   179\t└── Run as background task (async)\n   180\t```\n   181\t\n   182\t---\n   183\t\n   184\t### 2.3 DOMAIN C: LEADERBOARD SYSTEM\n   185\t\n   186\t#### C.1 Leaderboard Retrieval\n   187\t```\n   188\tREQ-LEAD-001: GET /api/v1/leaderboard\n   189\t├── WHEN a user requests leaderboard\n   190\t├── WITH query params:\n   191\t│   ├── period: all_time | weekly | monthly (default: all_time)\n   192\t│   ├── limit: int (default: 50, max: 100)\n   193\t│   └── offset: int (default: 0)\n   194\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\n   195\t│   ├── entries: array of { rank, user_id, display_name, avatar_url, total_xp, level }\n   196\t│   ├── current_user: { rank, total_xp } (even if not in top)\n   197\t│   └── total_users: int\n   198\t└── Order by total_xp DESC, created_at ASC (tiebreaker)\n   199\t```\n   200\t\n   201\t#### C.2 Weekly/Monthly Reset Logic\n   202\t```\n   203\tREQ-LEAD-002: Periodic Leaderboard Calculation\n   204\t├── WHEN period=weekly requested\n   205\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\n   206\t│   ├── Sum XP earned from QuizAttempts where created_at >= week_start\n   207\t│   ├── Add XP from UserProgress updates in same period\n   208\t│   └── Cache result for 5 minutes\n   209\t└── Weekly resets: Monday 00:00 UTC+7\n   210\t```\n   211\t\n   212\t---\n   213\t\n   214\t### 2.4 DOMAIN D: STREAK SYSTEM\n   215\t\n   216\t#### D.1 Streak Calculation\n   217\t```\n   218\tREQ-STREAK-001: Streak Update Logic\n   219\t├── WHEN a user performs any learning activity:\n   220\t│   ├── Discovers a motif\n   221\t│   ├── Completes a lesson\n   222\t│   ├── Submits a quiz\n   223\t│   └── Views lesson content\n   224\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\n   225\t│   ├── Check if user has activity today (UTC+7)\n   226\t│   ├── IF first activity today:\n   227\t│   │   ├── IF yesterday had activity: current_streak += 1\n   228\t│   │   ├── ELSE IF missed 1 day AND has freeze: use freeze, keep streak\n   229\t│   │   └── ELSE: current_streak = 1\n   230\t│   ├── Update longest_streak if current > longest\n   231\t│   └── Update last_active_at = now()\n   232\t└── Store last_streak_date in user record\n   233\t```\n   234\t\n   235\t#### D.2 Streak API\n   236\t```\n   237\tREQ-STREAK-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/streak\n   238\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\n   239\t│   ├── current_streak: int\n   240\t│   ├── longest_streak: int\n   241\t│   ├── last_active_date: date\n   242\t│   ├── streak_freezes_available: int (max 2)\n   243\t│   ├── streak_at_risk: bool (true if no activity today and streak > 0)\n   244\t│   └── days_until_next_badge: int\n   245\t└── Include streak badge progress\n   246\t\n   247\tREQ-STREAK-003: POST /api/v1/users/me/streak/freeze\n   248\t├── WHEN user activates streak freeze\n   249\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL:\n   250\t│   ├── Decrement streak_freezes_available\n   251\t│   ├── Set streak_frozen_until = tomorrow\n   252\t│   └── Return updated streak info\n   253\t└── IF no freezes available THEN return 400\n   254\t```\n   255\t\n   256\t---\n   257\t\n   258\t### 2.5 DOMAIN E: URN & MOTIF APIS\n   259\t\n   260\t#### E.1 Urns Listing\n   261\t```\n   262\tREQ-URN-001: GET /api/v1/urns\n   263\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return all 9 urns with:\n   264\t│   ├── id, slug, name, name_han\n   265\t│   ├── represents, description\n   266\t│   ├── thumbnail_url, model_url\n   267\t│   ├── display_order\n   268\t│   ├── motif_count: int (total)\n   269\t│   └── user_progress: { discovered, learned, mastered } (if authenticated)\n   270\t└── Order by display_order ASC\n   271\t```\n   272\t\n   273\t#### E.2 Single Urn Detail\n   274\t```\n   275\tREQ-URN-002: GET /api/v1/urns/{slug}\n   276\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return urn detail with:\n   277\t│   ├── All fields from URN-001\n   278\t│   ├── motifs: array (with progress status if authenticated)\n   279\t│   └── completion_percentage: float\n   280\t└── IF not found THEN return 404\n   281\t```\n   282\t\n   283\t#### E.3 Motif Detail\n   284\t```\n   285\tREQ-MOTIF-001: GET /api/v1/motifs/{motif_id}\n   286\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\n   287\t│   ├── id, urn_id, mesh_name, name, name_en\n   288\t│   ├── category, rarity\n   289\t│   ├── pos_x, pos_y, pos_z, bounding_radius\n   290\t│   ├── cam_pos_x, cam_pos_y, cam_pos_z\n   291\t│   ├── cam_look_at_x, cam_look_at_y, cam_look_at_z\n   292\t│   ├── thumbnail_url, silhouette_url\n   293\t│   ├── lesson: { intro_text, description, historical_context, symbolism, fun_fact }\n   294\t│   ├── quiz_question_count: int\n   295\t│   └── user_progress: { status, discovered_at, learned_at, mastered_at, xp_earned }\n   296\t└── Return silhouette_url only if not discovered\n   297\t```\n   298\t\n   299\t#### E.4 Motif Search\n   300\t```\n   301\tREQ-MOTIF-002: GET /api/v1/motifs/search\n   302\t├── WITH query params:\n   303\t│   ├── q: string (search name, name_en, description)\n   304\t│   ├── category: enum (optional)\n   305\t│   ├── rarity: enum (optional)\n   306\t│   ├── urn_id: UUID (optional)\n   307\t│   └── limit, offset\n   308\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return matching motifs\n   309\t└── Use PostgreSQL full-text search (ts_vector)\n   310\t```\n   311\t\n   312\t---\n   313\t\n   314\t### 2.6 DOMAIN F: COLLECTION (Pokédex)\n   315\t\n   316\t#### F.1 Full Collection View\n   317\t```\n   318\tREQ-COLL-001: GET /api/v1/users/me/collection\n   319\t├── ALREADY IMPLEMENTED (partial)\n   320\t├── ENHANCE to include:\n   321\t│   ├── Filter by: urn_slug, category, rarity, status\n   322\t│   ├── Sort by: discovered_at, name, rarity\n   323\t│   └── Pagination: limit, offset\n   324\t└── Return silhouette for undiscovered\n   325\t```\n   326\t\n   327\t#### F.2 Collection Statistics\n   328\t```\n   329\tREQ-COLL-002: GET /api/v1/users/me/collection/stats\n   330\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\n   331\t│   ├── total_motifs: 162\n   332\t│   ├── discovered: int, learned: int, mastered: int\n   333\t│   ├── by_urn: array of { urn_slug, total, discovered, learned, mastered }\n   334\t│   ├── by_category: array of { category, total, discovered, learned, mastered }\n   335\t│   ├── by_rarity: array of { rarity, total, discovered }\n   336\t│   └── completion_percentage: float\n   337\t└── Cache result for 1 minute\n   338\t```\n   339\t\n   340\t---\n   341\t\n   342\t### 2.7 DOMAIN G: USER PROFILE\n   343\t\n   344\t#### G.1 Profile Detail\n   345\t```\n   346\tREQ-PROF-001: GET /api/v1/users/me/profile\n   347\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL return:\n   348\t│   ├── user: { id, email, display_name, avatar_url, role, created_at }\n   349\t│   ├── stats: { total_xp, rank, xp_to_next_rank }\n   350\t│   ├── streak: { current, longest, last_active }\n   351\t│   ├── collection: { discovered, learned, mastered, total }\n   352\t│   ├── badges: { earned_count, recent_badges }\n   353\t│   ├── quiz: { attempts, avg_score, perfect_count }\n   354\t│   └── activity: { days_active, favorite_urn, favorite_category }\n   355\t└── Aggregate from multiple tables\n   356\t```\n   357\t\n   358\t#### G.2 Profile Update\n   359\t```\n   360\tREQ-PROF-002: PATCH /api/v1/users/me/profile\n   361\t├── WITH payload:\n   362\t│   ├── display_name: string (optional)\n   363\t│   └── avatar_url: string (optional)\n   364\t├── THE SYSTEM SHALL validate and update\n   365\t└── Return updated profile\n   366\t```\n   367\t\n   368\t#### G.3 Public Profile (Optional)\n   369\t```\n   370\tREQ-PROF-003: GET /api/v1/